# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local
data/*.json.tmp
data/_history/
data/*.json.corrupt-*

# NOTE: data/ (store documents) and public/data/exercise-library.json (generated
# library) are deliberately committed. Do not ignore them. data/_history/ is the
# local per-doc undo trail (pruned to 50 snapshots) and stays out of git; the
# off-machine copy is the data-backup-<hostname> branch pushed by the storage
# plugin.

